<title>USA: HDS Network names Callahan president/CEO. [CORRECTED 13:19 GMT]</title>
<headline>HDS Network names Callahan president/CEO. [CORRECTED 13:19 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>HDS Network Systems Inc said Friday it had named Edward Callahan president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Arthur Spector, who will continue as chairman, HDS said.</p>
<p>The company said Callahan was also elected to the board.</p>
<p>Prior to joining HDS, Callahan was president and chief operating officer of Summa Four Inc of Manchester, N.H.</p>
<p>HDS makes network computers and related software.</p>
<p>(Corrects from &quot;HDS is a provider of telecommunications switches.&quot;)</p>
